  {# ---------------- HOW TO JOIN ---------------- #}
  <section class="section" id="join">
    <h2>How to join</h2>
    <p>
      Whether you&rsquo;re a long-time ILCA/Laser racer or looking for a fun way to be outside
      and on the water in the summertime, the Buffalo Laser Class Association offers an
      environment for racers at all skill levels to thrive. Join us to be part of exciting
      races, learn from the best, and contribute to a thriving sailing community. Sail fast!
    </p>
    <p>
      The easiest way to get started is simply to show up. On any given Monday during the
      season, we gather around 5&nbsp;p.m. at our two launch sites &mdash; Sail Buffalo and
      Dale&rsquo;s Marine Service (see <a href="#where-we-sail">Where we sail</a> below).
      Drop-ins are always welcome.
    </p>
    <p>
      Membership is inexpensive and club-based. To sail with us you&rsquo;ll need to complete
      our participation waiver, and members pay modest annual dues. If you use one of the
      club&rsquo;s donor (loaner) boats rather than your own, dues aren&rsquo;t required &mdash;
      though a voluntary donation toward maintaining the loaner fleet is always appreciated.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/assets/docs/BLCA-Participation-Waiver.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Download the participation waiver (PDF)
      </a>
    </p>
    <p>
      Questions? Reach out to us at
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  {# ---------------- WHERE WE SAIL ---------------- #}
  <section class="section" id="where-we-sail">
    <h2>Where we sail</h2>
    <p>
      Boat storage and launching are out of <strong>Sail Buffalo</strong> and
      <strong>Dale&rsquo;s Marine Service</strong> in Buffalo, N.Y. Parking is available
      inside Dale&rsquo;s yard, or on the street for Sail Buffalo.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our racing area is typically just west of the Erie Basin Marina breakwall. Tows out of
      the river are often offered by the Race Committee.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our Monday Night Series and weekly post-race BBQ are based at Dale&rsquo;s Marina.
    </p>
  </section>

</div>
